			(property "Description" "Infineon BGA524N6 SiGe GNSS LNA, 1550-1615 MHz, 19.6 dB gain, 0.55 dB NF, 2.5 mA, VCC 1.5-3.3 V, TSNP-6-2. Pins per Infineon BGA524N6 Data Sheet Rev 3.5 (2021-08-31) Table 1: 1 GND, 2 VCC, 3 AO, 4 GND, 5 AI, 6 PON. AI absolute max 0.9 V -> DC block required ahead of it when a bias-tee is fitted. PON max VCC+0.3 V."
