			(property "Description" "TI TPS7A0228PDBVR, 200 mA ultra-low-IQ LDO, fixed 2.8 V, active output discharge, SOT-23-5 (DBV). Pins per TI SBVS277C Table 5-1 (DBV): 1 IN, 2 GND, 3 EN, 4 NC, 5 OUT. VIN 1.5-6.0 V, VEN(HI) 1.1 V, VEN(LOW) 0.3 V, CIN 1 uF, COUT 1-22 uF (Recommended Operating Conditions). Orderable TPS7A0228PDBVR listed Active in the SBVS277C packaging addendum."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
