			(property "Description" "Generic eSIM/MFF2 UICC footprint (DNP), contacts named by ISO/IEC 7816 contact number (C1 VCC, C2 RST, C3 CLK, C5 GND, C6 VPP, C7 I/O). Mirrors the unpopulated MFF2 footprint on the nRF9151 DK (DK User Guide 'SIM and eSIM'). PLACEHOLDER: the MFF2 package pad-number-to-contact mapping (ETSI TS 102 671) was not verified -- check before fitting a part."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
