		(property "Description" "DNP LNA bypass link (after the DC block, so no bias reaches the DC-grounded GPS pin). Fit with R123 removed to try passive operation. 0402 on the RF path (not the board-standard 0603): smaller pads are a smaller discontinuity on a 50-ohm line at 0.7-2.2 GHz."
			(at 370.84 287.02 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
