		(property "Description" "Fanstel BT840 (nRF52840) -- now the BLE bridge to the laptop, UART to the nRF9151 host. Pin data per Fanstel BT840/F/E/X/XE Ver 1.15 Pin Function table (pdftotext -raw). Normal-voltage mode: VDDH (F4) tied to VDD; DCCH (F5) open; USB unused (VBUS, D+, D- open). 32.768 kHz crystal is external on the plain BT840 (DS model summary) -- not fitted, P0.00/P0.01 left free for it."
			(at 533.4 165.1 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
