		(property "Description" "Host MCU + LTE-M/NB-IoT modem + GNSS. Nordic nRF9151 SiP: LTE-M/NB-IoT/DECT NR+ modem + GPS L1 C/A receiver + Arm Cortex-M33 (1 MB flash, 256 kB RAM). LGA 12.1 x 11.1 x 1.2 mm, 113 pins. Orderable codes per nRF9151 PS v1.0 'Ordering information': nRF9151-LACA-R (MOQ 2000), nRF9151-LACA-R7 (MOQ 100). Pin numbers/names transcribed from the nRF9151 PS 'Pin assignments' table (docs.nordicsemi.com ps_nrf9151/pin.html, HTML rendition of PS v1.0; the PDF was not downloadable, see connectivity_notes.md). VDD 3.0-5.5 V, VDD_GPIO 1.7-3.6 V (PS 'Operating conditions'). nRESET: external pull-up NOT allowed. SIM_DET: leave floating. RESERVED 31-33: solder, no electrical connection; RESERVED 81-104 (RSVD, top/bottom edges): do not connect. All GND pins are stacked on one symbol pin location (same net)."
			(at 228.6 162.56 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
